mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>52.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, in the given context, the area under the curve represents the total accumulation of medication. So, the total medication delivered is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"589\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"border: 1px solid lightgray;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 1.8em; margin: 0.4em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.4em; top: 0px; max-width: 1.8em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle style=\"border: 1px solid lightgray\"><mpadded height=\"+4pt\" depth=\"+4pt\" lspace=\"4pt\" width=\"+8pt\"><mn>52</mn></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> milligrams.</p>\n</div>",
